","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"object’s progress changes. The progress may change due to a resource being"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downloaded or because the pack discovers during the download that more"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"resources are required for offline viewing. This notification is posted","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whenever any field in the "},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property changes."}],"title":"MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepackprogresschangednotification"}}}